join Petrus (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Petrus (Aggravated)
Petrus: Two born. Both living.
- That's the first time in a while
	Hope: That's the first time in a while.
	Petrus: Third time I've had two born. First time both lived.
	Petrus: Water's the whole of it. Nothing clever. Animal that drinks enough carries a kid to term, animal that doesn't, doesn't.
	Petrus: Ten years I've been telling people that and getting looked at like I'm talking about the weather.
- You were talking about the weather
	Hope: You were talking about the weather.
	Petrus: ...Yes. All right.
[signal arg="hearts:petrus:2"]
set {GameState.petrus_herd_growing} = true
